// Port of libretro slang-shaders crt/shaders/crt-consumer.slang (preset crt/crt-consumer.slangp:
// one pass, filter_linear0 = true -> bilinear; wrap_mode0 = clamp_to_border).
// Original header (no author line in the source file):
